{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"d9735580-c9fc-42b5-864d-ecb9480d6e74","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Based on the screenshot from [shot.png](file:///tmp/agy-img-probe/shot.png):\n\n### Content Summary\nThe screenshot shows a snippet of a chat conversation interface between a user and an AI assistant (`DA`):\n\n1. **Previous message snippet (top):**\n   \u003e *\"Once you describe what text or buttons are showing, I will tell you exactly which button to click next!\"*\n\n2. **User message:**\n   - **Text:** `\"her\"`\n   - **Attachment:** A file thumbnail under the label **Context files**.\n\n3. **Assistant response (`DA`):**\n   \u003e *\"It looks like the image or text didn’t come through yet!*  \n   \u003e *Could you paste the image here, or briefly tell me the main heading and the buttons you see on the screen? I’ll guide you right away.\"*\n\n---\n\n### Main Heading \u0026 Visible Buttons\n- **Main Heading:** There is **no page heading** present in this view; the conversation flows directly in the message thread.\n- **Visible Buttons:** There are **no action buttons** displayed in this visible crop (aside from the top edge of what appears to be the chat input bar at the bottom).\n","duration_seconds":6.273961,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":24994,"output_tokens":305,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":0,"total_tokens":25299}}}
